          <p>Given the feedback from my project manager and Verizon, I sketched low-fidelity concepts to <strong>explore user flow, potential screens, and features</strong> that addressed the specific needs of users.</p>
          <div class="image-row-single image-row-single-wide">
            <img data-tilt src={img('07.webp')} alt="Low-fidelity wireframes for the SureCall app" />
          </div>
        </div>
      </section>

      <section class="white-block">
        <div class="wrap">
